K6 overdamped drift u - V = -psi_x/gamma ; mobility = 1/gamma
   B1 (Fokker-Planck, gamma = alpha/tau): mobility tau/alpha = alpha tau -> alpha* = 1
   B2 (BGK, tau_c = tau_pi = tau/2alpha): tau/(2 alpha) = alpha tau -> alpha* = sqrt(2)/2

